sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant AU as Audit Store

    A->>FE: Open review dashboard
    FE->>BE: GET /admin/reviews/queue
    BE->>DB: Fetch flagged sessions
    BE-->>FE: Queue items

    A->>FE: Submit decision
    FE->>BE: POST /admin/reviews/{session_id}/decision
    BE->>DB: Validate session status
    BE->>DB: Insert admin review
    BE->>DB: Update session and user KYC status
    BE->>AU: Log audit event
    BE-->>FE: Decision result payload
